OL,3,GNEWSARoundabout to open as major scheme
OL,4,Ais completed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road improvement scheme that has
OL,7,Ftaken two-and-a-half years to complete
OL,8,Fis due to open on Friday.
OL,10,FEast Riding of Yorkshire Council said
OL,11,Fthe Jock's Lodge scheme, near Beverley,
OL,12,Fwhich cost #87m, was the largest
OL,13,Fhighways project ever undertaken by the
OL,14,Flocal authority.
OL,16,FOn Friday evening, the A1079/Jock's
OL,17,FLodge roundabout will fully reopen,
OL,18,Fwith the remaining restrictions on the
OL,19,FA164 due to be removed in the coming
OL,20,Fweeks.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
