OL,3,GNEWSARoundabout to open as major scheme
OL,4,Ais completed
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Michael Lee said: "I want to
OL,7,Fsay a big thank you to drivers for
OL,8,Ftheir patience and understanding
OL,9,Fthrough all the construction work, but
OL,10,FI'm sure they will soon benefit from
OL,11,Fsmoother journeys on this route to the
OL,12,Frest of the East Riding."
